mer interviews and branch comparisons would strengthen the analysis.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00081",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[70]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 14104,
      "endIndex": 14117,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "8 Conclusion",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00082",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[71]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 14117,
      "endIndex": 14482,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Tong Keow keeps traditional ingredients approachable through household foods, preparation services and recognisable packaging. Soup displays connect herbs with cooking and light nourishment; portioned packs reduce household effort. Local branding and confirmed manufacture link products with Singapore’s setting, while mixed foods create access across communities.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00083",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[72]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 14482,
      "endIndex": 14752,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "These adaptations support everyday visibility and opportunities for use, rather than demonstrating clinical effectiveness. Retail access and clinical care remain distinct: treatment requires a qualified practitioner to assess the person’s pattern of signs and symptoms.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00084",
